(3631969, 509375, 34041, '<td valign="top">The tilted horizon detracts a bit, IMO, especially around the ceiling of the room. The B&amp;W conversion could have used just a bit more contrast.  Subjects and composition are good.  Overall a 6 from me.</td>', 'The tilted horizon detracts a bit, IMO, especially around the ceiling of the room. The B&W conversion could have used just a bit more contrast.  Subjects and composition are good.  Overall a 6 from me.', '2007-05-09 08:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3631975, 509335, 34041, '<td valign="top">Great color tone. I know the subject needs to include some foreground earth, but, IMO, the image would be improved by cropping up from the bottom just a bit, to avoid having the bold line between the plowed eartha and the background fall so exactly in the center of the image. Stepping back a few feet to get more space on both vertical sides would also help, I think, to show the amount of work that needs to be done.  But those are nits, it;''s avery nice shot - Overall a 6 from me.</td>', 'Great color tone. I know the subject needs to include some foreground earth, but, IMO, the image would be improved by cropping up from the bottom just a bit, to avoid having the bold line between the plowed eartha and the background fall so exactly in the center of the image. Stepping back a few feet to get more space on both vertical sides would also help, I think, to show the amount of work that needs to be done.  But those are nits, it;''s avery nice shot - Overall a 6 from me.', '2007-05-09 08:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3631979, 509419, 34041, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition selection.  IMO, it seems too tight, and I wish I could see more of the costumes, which I would think should be amazing, given the headware.</td>', 'Interesting composition selection.  IMO, it seems too tight, and I wish I could see more of the costumes, which I would think should be amazing, given the headware.', '2007-05-09 08:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3631986, 509330, 34041, '<td valign="top">Good lighting, but I think the focus is just a bit soft.  Also the large white space at the bottom distracts my eye from the actual mask.  I would suggest cropping up a bit to remove some of that. 6</td>', 'Good lighting, but I think the focus is just a bit soft.  Also the large white space at the bottom distracts my eye from the actual mask.  I would suggest cropping up a bit to remove some of that. 6', '2007-05-09 08:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3631989, 506636, 34041, '<td valign="top">Oh, such a nice idea, but so small, and even being so small, there are extra people in the shot that should be cropped out, on both the left and right.</td>', 'Oh, such a nice idea, but so small, and even being so small, there are extra people in the shot that should be cropped out, on both the left and right.', '2007-05-09 08:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3631996, 508364, 34041, '<td valign="top">Not sure how this is an event, but I''ll assume it is.  Nice colour tones.  The guy in the left in the white shirt drawa my eye away from the subjects.  Perhaps waiting a few seconds for him to leave the frame would have really improved this shot. Also, a bit dark on the smaller boys face.  Getting them to turn just slightly so the light hit their eyes better would have also help.  5 from me.</td>', 'Not sure how this is an event, but I''ll assume it is.  Nice colour tones.  The guy in the left in the white shirt drawa my eye away from the subjects.  Perhaps waiting a few seconds for him to leave the frame would have really improved this shot. Also, a bit dark on the smaller boys face.  Getting them to turn just slightly so the light hit their eyes better would have also help.  5 from me.', '2007-05-09 08:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3632003, 507306, 34041, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but I find the lighting to be very harsh, and from a bad angle. Having the suject turn slightly and step more into the light, and fixing your exposure would avoid the blow outs on the face and arms.</td>', 'Nice idea, but I find the lighting to be very harsh, and from a bad angle. Having the suject turn slightly and step more into the light, and fixing your exposure would avoid the blow outs on the face and arms.', '2007-05-09 08:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3632009, 509276, 34041, '<td valign="top">great shot. Top 10, I think. great B &amp; W conversion, great Dof, great focus, great composition to just get the head.  The only detraction, IMO, is the OOF foreground element (I can''t even tell what it is -looks like it might be the top of steering wheel???). An 8 from me.</td>', 'great shot. Top 10, I think. great B & W conversion, great Dof, great focus, great composition to just get the head.  The only detraction, IMO, is the OOF foreground element (I can''t even tell what it is -looks like it might be the top of steering wheel???). An 8 from me.', '2007-05-09 08:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3632012, 508415, 34041, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Good cmoposition, great use of Dof to draw the eye to the main subject in an otherwise busy shot. 7</td>', 'Nice shot. Good cmoposition, great use of Dof to draw the eye to the main subject in an otherwise busy shot. 7', '2007-05-09 08:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3632014, 507645, 34041, '<td valign="top">How cute. Great focus and use of Dof to highlight the boy.  I just wish there was slightly more of a catchlight in the lads eyes. That would really make this shot pop. 7 as it is.</td>', 'How cute. Great focus and use of Dof to highlight the boy.  I just wish there was slightly more of a catchlight in the lads eyes. That would really make this shot pop. 7 as it is.', '2007-05-09 08:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3632018, 509501, 34041, '<td valign="top">Great expression, and the perfect title to highlight it.  Nice job. I might have gone for just a touch more contrast to get to true blacks and whites, but overall a 7 from me.</td>', 'Great expression, and the perfect title to highlight it.  Nice job. I might have gone for just a touch more contrast to get to true blacks and whites, but overall a 7 from me.', '2007-05-09 08:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3632028, 507005, 34041, '<td valign="top">Cute.  But, she seems a bit cramped inside this very tightly cropped shot. If there was a possibility of a reshoot, I''d suggest getting down on the floor, closer to her level, and looking more upwards into her face, instead of down at the top of her head, and leaving more blank space above her head.  If you had to, you could lookse the boots, as well, as they detract from the face. Also, I find this a bit too contrast-y, and there are some blown highlights on her face, near the nose. 5</td>', 'Cute.  But, she seems a bit cramped inside this very tightly cropped shot. If there was a possibility of a reshoot, I''d suggest getting down on the floor, closer to her level, and looking more upwards into her face, instead of down at the top of her head, and leaving more blank space above her head.  If you had to, you could lookse the boots, as well, as they detract from the face. Also, I find this a bit too contrast-y, and there are some blown highlights on her face, near the nose. 5', '2007-05-09 08:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3632034, 508461, 34041, '<td valign="top">Awesome colors. Nice tight crop. My only comment is that her face looks a bit oversharpened. 6</td>', 'Awesome colors. Nice tight crop. My only comment is that her face looks a bit oversharpened. 6', '2007-05-09 08:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3632044, 507555, 34041, '<td valign="top">IMO, I don''t really like the blown highlights here. I think you might have been trying for a high-key shot with lots of great colors in the outfits, but it didn''t quite make it. 5</td>', 'IMO, I don''t really like the blown highlights here. I think you might have been trying for a high-key shot with lots of great colors in the outfits, but it didn''t quite make it. 5', '2007-05-09 08:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
