(3633800, 509230, 77968, '<td valign="top">very very nice job on depth of field with this piece. gorgeous color saturation, the architecture unfortunately does not suit the floral setting, but the colors are superb</td>', 'very very nice job on depth of field with this piece. gorgeous color saturation, the architecture unfortunately does not suit the floral setting, but the colors are superb', '2007-05-09 15:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
