(3634326, 509176, 75713, '<td valign="top">An interesting abstract photo which does not, in my opinion, meet the challenge... unless there is something I am not understanding .... or missing?  This shot is photographed well for an abstract... but what does the writing mean.... please forgive my ignorance if there is a relevent cultural connection.</td>', 'An interesting abstract photo which does not, in my opinion, meet the challenge... unless there is something I am not understanding .... or missing?  This shot is photographed well for an abstract... but what does the writing mean.... please forgive my ignorance if there is a relevent cultural connection.', '2007-05-09 17:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3634464, 508461, 74371, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. Is slightly out of focus. Those ladies tend to move quite quickly and to capture them is sometimes difficult although I would have thought your flash would have ''stopped'' action a little better. <br/> <br/>Otherwise, I like this photo!</td>', 'Nice photo. Is slightly out of focus. Those ladies tend to move quite quickly and to capture them is sometimes difficult although I would have thought your flash would have ''stopped'' action a little better.  Otherwise, I like this photo!', '2007-05-09 18:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3634472, 507306, 74371, '<td valign="top">I am a little disappointed that this young fellow is so out of focus. With a clear, crisp focus... thei picture would have jumped right out and grabbed me. It didn''t. (4)</td>', 'I am a little disappointed that this young fellow is so out of focus. With a clear, crisp focus... thei picture would have jumped right out and grabbed me. It didn''t. (4)', '2007-05-09 18:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
