(3635195, 509521, 75386, '<td valign="top">Wow what a nice photo, nice going on the color.  Is this a dance? and where in in Japan is it?<br/> <br/>Texas, Japan! cool!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-05-16 00:46:43.</i></td>', 'Wow what a nice photo, nice going on the color.  Is this a dance? and where in in Japan is it? Texas, Japan! cool!', '2007-05-09 21:54:40.000000', '2007-05-16 01:46:43.000000', 1),
(3635205, 509375, 75386, '<td valign="top">Really nice, i like the camera angle, the mood is great too.<br/>The motion blur brings out the fact that they are in...motion, and not 4 people just posing.  I had to say that because some people might comment that there is blur</td>', 'Really nice, i like the camera angle, the mood is great too.The motion blur brings out the fact that they are in...motion, and not 4 people just posing.  I had to say that because some people might comment that there is blur', '2007-05-09 21:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
