(3635218, 507493, 75386, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  i like the line formed by the art in relation to the border of the photo.  The lighting is bright but the surroundings softens it up.<br/>The motion of the person adds a dynamic element.</td>', 'Very nice.  i like the line formed by the art in relation to the border of the photo.  The lighting is bright but the surroundings softens it up.The motion of the person adds a dynamic element.', '2007-05-09 22:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
