(3635271, 508461, 35352, '<td valign="top">A little too snapshot like. The shadow behind her head and the 2 men are distracting. You''ve captured the colours well though.</td>', 'A little too snapshot like. The shadow behind her head and the 2 men are distracting. You''ve captured the colours well though.', '2007-05-09 22:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3635277, 509330, 19672, '<td valign="top">Intriguing.....though I think there is a touch too much glare.  Perhaps too shallow of a DOF as well.</td>', 'Intriguing.....though I think there is a touch too much glare.  Perhaps too shallow of a DOF as well.', '2007-05-09 22:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3635278, 507493, 35352, '<td valign="top">The main subject is the girl but she''s out of focus. I think this would be a stunning photo if it was made more intimate somehow.</td>', 'The main subject is the girl but she''s out of focus. I think this would be a stunning photo if it was made more intimate somehow.', '2007-05-09 22:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3635282, 509260, 19672, '<td valign="top">Great colors....toob bad the sky is a bit white washed. What''s that weird light blue thing in the background?<br/> <br/>Foreground/subject "great capture", background is what really keeps this photo from reaching it''s full potential.</td>', 'Great colors....toob bad the sky is a bit white washed. What''s that weird light blue thing in the background? Foreground/subject "great capture", background is what really keeps this photo from reaching it''s full potential.', '2007-05-09 22:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3635287, 508286, 35352, '<td valign="top">Its best to make full use of the 640 pixel limit - you put yourself at a huge disadvantage if you don''t. It would also be good to see some context here - who is eating this?</td>', 'Its best to make full use of the 640 pixel limit - you put yourself at a huge disadvantage if you don''t. It would also be good to see some context here - who is eating this?', '2007-05-09 22:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
