(3635300, 509512, 35352, '<td valign="top">Great composition and nice colours. Might need some more contrasts and really needs some more focus on the 2 competitors.</td>', 'Great composition and nice colours. Might need some more contrasts and really needs some more focus on the 2 competitors.', '2007-05-09 22:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3635303, 508637, 19672, '<td valign="top">Hoo-rah!!!!<br/> <br/>Great capture...only complaints is the weird bokeh in the BG and the fact that you couldn''t get the entire lance. (8)</td>', 'Hoo-rah!!!! Great capture...only complaints is the weird bokeh in the BG and the fact that you couldn''t get the entire lance. (8)', '2007-05-09 22:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3635306, 508189, 35352, '<td valign="top">This is great street scene. I''m not really see a cultural event - maybe the buses have something to do with it.</td>', 'This is great street scene. I''m not really see a cultural event - maybe the buses have something to do with it.', '2007-05-09 22:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3635310, 509151, 19672, '<td valign="top">Very classy photo...8</td>', 'Very classy photo...8', '2007-05-09 22:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3635314, 507976, 35352, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, I don''t think the lighting is working in your favour.</td>', 'Unfortunately, I don''t think the lighting is working in your favour.', '2007-05-09 22:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3635315, 509488, 19672, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 4. Why?<br/> <br/>I almost passed by without comment but realized this should score higher and fails to please for one reason in particular. The colors feel washed out. Like looking at a 70''s print.<br/> <br/>Just a little "hue/saturation" could really enhance this. I increased overall saturation. But especially yellow (to make the grass greener, yes you would think green would do it but yellow often works better). And red. I also hue shifted the red a bit to get a much more truer red.<br/> <br/>It helps Mr. M stand out ;)</td>', 'I gave this a 4. Why? I almost passed by without comment but realized this should score higher and fails to please for one reason in particular. The colors feel washed out. Like looking at a 70''s print. Just a little "hue/saturation" could really enhance this. I increased overall saturation. But especially yellow (to make the grass greener, yes you would think green would do it but yellow often works better). And red. I also hue shifted the red a bit to get a much more truer red. It helps Mr. M stand out ;)', '2007-05-09 22:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3635316, 509053, 19672, '<td valign="top">Talk about color</td>', 'Talk about color', '2007-05-09 22:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3635317, 508048, 35352, '<td valign="top">The art I suspect should have equal attention in the photo as the man - except most of it is too dark to see properly.</td>', 'The art I suspect should have equal attention in the photo as the man - except most of it is too dark to see properly.', '2007-05-09 22:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3635319, 507306, 35352, '<td valign="top">This is too blurry and the face is too dark. The framing is good.</td>', 'This is too blurry and the face is too dark. The framing is good.', '2007-05-09 22:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3635321, 507695, 19672, '<td valign="top">Good composition and capture....tonality is a bit off. But this was obviously taken at night. So it''s a challenge to keep that tonal feel.</td>', 'Good composition and capture....tonality is a bit off. But this was obviously taken at night. So it''s a challenge to keep that tonal feel.', '2007-05-09 22:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3635322, 508415, 35352, '<td valign="top">This is one of the better photos in this challenge. Its on topic, composition is great, the coours really stand out. I love the DOF and you got the right person in focus. THe background isn''t distracting.</td>', 'This is one of the better photos in this challenge. Its on topic, composition is great, the coours really stand out. I love the DOF and you got the right person in focus. THe background isn''t distracting.', '2007-05-09 22:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3635324, 509485, 19672, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous.....  10 <br/>(only complaint is that I''d like a bit more sharpness, but that''s probably in part due to the small size...that and the blue of the sky looks a tad off. Perhaps darken the blue a shade or so.)</td>', 'Gorgeous.....  10 (only complaint is that I''d like a bit more sharpness, but that''s probably in part due to the small size...that and the blue of the sky looks a tad off. Perhaps darken the blue a shade or so.)', '2007-05-09 22:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3635325, 509366, 19672, '<td valign="top">Good use of hue de-sat. Would work better in an advanced challenge as you wouldn''t have the few pink artifacts. (7)</td>', 'Good use of hue de-sat. Would work better in an advanced challenge as you wouldn''t have the few pink artifacts. (7)', '2007-05-09 22:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3635328, 509369, 19672, '<td valign="top">Oh, please tell me what lens you used for this.....<br/> <br/>This just rawks.... (8)</td>', 'Oh, please tell me what lens you used for this..... This just rawks.... (8)', '2007-05-09 22:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
