(3635334, 508283, 35352, '<td valign="top">There''s a nice intensity about this photo. The grass is a little too saturated and her face could use little more brightness.</td>', 'There''s a nice intensity about this photo. The grass is a little too saturated and her face could use little more brightness.', '2007-05-09 22:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3635357, 509463, 35352, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure a car crash qualifies as a cultural event. There''s good composition here between the car and the lady. She''s out of focus though putting too much emphasis on the car.</td>', 'I''m not sure a car crash qualifies as a cultural event. There''s good composition here between the car and the lady. She''s out of focus though putting too much emphasis on the car.', '2007-05-09 23:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3635363, 509486, 35352, '<td valign="top">Great DOF and colour. You''ve really caputred the intensities on the men''s faces. YOu could probably crop out some of the top though. I think this photo ismore on challenge that most.</td>', 'Great DOF and colour. You''ve really caputred the intensities on the men''s faces. YOu could probably crop out some of the top though. I think this photo ismore on challenge that most.', '2007-05-09 23:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3635374, 506675, 35352, '<td valign="top">There''s no cultural event here. A good use of the window to create a different view of the world. However the buildings - what we are looking at - are out of focus.</td>', 'There''s no cultural event here. A good use of the window to create a different view of the world. However the buildings - what we are looking at - are out of focus.', '2007-05-09 23:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3635381, 509276, 35352, '<td valign="top">While we can''t see the cultural event here - the context - you''vereally capture this guys human qualities - his experience at the event he''s at. YOu can imagine what he''s getting out of it and what he''s putting into it. I love the DOF and the detail - just hte right exposure. The object in the foreground is a little distracting.</td>', 'While we can''t see the cultural event here - the context - you''vereally capture this guys human qualities - his experience at the event he''s at. YOu can imagine what he''s getting out of it and what he''s putting into it. I love the DOF and the detail - just hte right exposure. The object in the foreground is a little distracting.', '2007-05-09 23:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3635401, 509032, 35352, '<td valign="top">A great silhouette! The sky is just right - not too overpowering but adds something to the photo. The people need to some focus or sharpening. The land could have filled more of the seen. You''ve got a great S shape there of the land and bushes and I think centering that may have worked even better in this case.</td>', 'A great silhouette! The sky is just right - not too overpowering but adds something to the photo. The people need to some focus or sharpening. The land could have filled more of the seen. You''ve got a great S shape there of the land and bushes and I think centering that may have worked even better in this case.', '2007-05-09 23:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3635408, 509187, 35352, '<td valign="top">Nice colour, crystal clear photo. I like the angle you''ve shot this from but one of the heads as been cropped in half. Probably better to crop that top head out all together and also add a little space on the right for the 2 lead singers.</td>', 'Nice colour, crystal clear photo. I like the angle you''ve shot this from but one of the heads as been cropped in half. Probably better to crop that top head out all together and also add a little space on the right for the 2 lead singers.', '2007-05-09 23:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3635412, 509357, 35352, '<td valign="top">My eyes are drawn to the chipboard, not the river.</td>', 'My eyes are drawn to the chipboard, not the river.', '2007-05-09 23:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3635414, 507912, 51793, '<td valign="top">I find this image a bit grainy for the subject at hand. IMPO I would only use a grain for an image that I want it to look rough, dirty, or something in that nature. I understand that some camera''s just produce a ton of image grain (mine being one) but lighting really helps with that. Speaking of lighting, I see that you didn''t have much light here. When you want some of your subject to look faded you should fade an entire side of the image so everything flows nicely. <br/> <br/>I like the cross and the idea but there are just a few things that do not fit the image, <br/>1 - The lighting<br/>2 - The amount of room that is on the lower corner just below the cross. It looks like it is just too close to the image to look staged.<br/>3 - The image Grain.<br/>4 - The slight shadows at the top and the right of the image. Not really distracting like many say but it does stand out like a sore thumb. <br/> <br/>Try using the color balance and levels adjustments when processing your images, It really helps and brings out a lot. <br/> <br/>Good luck mate.</td>', 'I find this image a bit grainy for the subject at hand. IMPO I would only use a grain for an image that I want it to look rough, dirty, or something in that nature. I understand that some camera''s just produce a ton of image grain (mine being one) but lighting really helps with that. Speaking of lighting, I see that you didn''t have much light here. When you want some of your subject to look faded you should fade an entire side of the image so everything flows nicely.  I like the cross and the idea but there are just a few things that do not fit the image, 1 - The lighting2 - The amount of room that is on the lower corner just below the cross. It looks like it is just too close to the image to look staged.3 - The image Grain.4 - The slight shadows at the top and the right of the image. Not really distracting like many say but it does stand out like a sore thumb.  Try using the color balance and levels adjustments when processing your images, It really helps and brings out a lot.  Good luck mate.', '2007-05-09 23:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3635426, 509521, 35352, '<td valign="top">WOW. The smoothness of the photo really goes with your subject. The colours are amazing and the subtle background really works. The only thing you may have done differently is not have the women dead centered.</td>', 'WOW. The smoothness of the photo really goes with your subject. The colours are amazing and the subtle background really works. The only thing you may have done differently is not have the women dead centered.', '2007-05-09 23:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3635431, 509369, 51793, '<td valign="top">I love the fisheye lens. I bought one for my cheapo that screws on and it just doesn''t turn out images that well. I can''t wait until I get a real camera... Okay well enough about me lets talk about you.  <br/> <br/>Very odd that there is a huge pile of bones there that people are staring at. From your POV you had every inch of it in mind when you shot this. I love it... The sky does not look boring with the clouds in it and the brightness of the buildings really make this image stand out. Only think I can really find wrong with this image is the fact that there is construction going on in the back ground behind the buildings, and that is not your fault one bit. Other than that there is nothing wrong with this. I give you a 9 for creativity, focus, color, subject, and a sweet fisheye. Good luck.</td>', 'I love the fisheye lens. I bought one for my cheapo that screws on and it just doesn''t turn out images that well. I can''t wait until I get a real camera... Okay well enough about me lets talk about you.   Very odd that there is a huge pile of bones there that people are staring at. From your POV you had every inch of it in mind when you shot this. I love it... The sky does not look boring with the clouds in it and the brightness of the buildings really make this image stand out. Only think I can really find wrong with this image is the fact that there is construction going on in the back ground behind the buildings, and that is not your fault one bit. Other than that there is nothing wrong with this. I give you a 9 for creativity, focus, color, subject, and a sweet fisheye. Good luck.', '2007-05-09 23:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3635442, 509230, 51793, '<td valign="top">Your image is very pretty but the background just has too much going on in it. There are people walking all over the place. I would like to have seen a bit more image size here as it seems cropped too much. Great color though, 7</td>', 'Your image is very pretty but the background just has too much going on in it. There are people walking all over the place. I would like to have seen a bit more image size here as it seems cropped too much. Great color though, 7', '2007-05-09 23:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
