(3641436, 509512, 78062, '<td valign="top">That''s a great pic. Captures the life of it perfectly. Also, I love the look on the two guys on the bike things, it''s like they never realised it would be this fast or the corners would come up so soon, one of those "That''s not so tough" moments.<br/> <br/>Good job.</td>', 'That''s a great pic. Captures the life of it perfectly. Also, I love the look on the two guys on the bike things, it''s like they never realised it would be this fast or the corners would come up so soon, one of those "That''s not so tough" moments. Good job.', '2007-05-12 07:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3641437, 509068, 78062, '<td valign="top">Nice tones here, and I like how theres something in all parts of the photograph, you just have to look for it.</td>', 'Nice tones here, and I like how theres something in all parts of the photograph, you just have to look for it.', '2007-05-12 07:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
