(3646901, 509424, 20018, '<td valign="top">Although I can find elements of a war protest here:<br/>the word peace, well, I guess that''s all.  I don''t see the human subject''s ''protest'' in their faces.  In fact I only see 2 people and 1 face...not really a protest to me.  I see nothing about war per se.  I like your attempt on such a different subject idea though.</td>', 'Although I can find elements of a war protest here:the word peace, well, I guess that''s all.  I don''t see the human subject''s ''protest'' in their faces.  In fact I only see 2 people and 1 face...not really a protest to me.  I see nothing about war per se.  I like your attempt on such a different subject idea though.', '2007-05-14 10:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3646915, 509276, 20018, '<td valign="top">I like the face, and the interaction between the subject and the viewer.  One of the best in this challenge.</td>', 'I like the face, and the interaction between the subject and the viewer.  One of the best in this challenge.', '2007-05-14 10:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
