(3653995, 509430, 62634, '<td valign="top">Yea! A Top 10, Thank you for all the wonderful comments and votes.  <br/>I shot this with my Sigma 28-70 2.8 at dusk in the back yard.  My bush had just started sprouting white flowers and I thought it went nice with the outfit.  I saw the challenge and just knew I had to enter.  My daughter loves tea but she only gets it every now and then so this is actually apple juice. I wanted a lower shot of her looking at the camera but you know kids and I was lucky to get this angle.  I did get one or two staight on but a little out of focus.  It wasn''t long before I got the Daaaaddd!!!! Also as you will see in my outtakes she did a good job of looking serious and she does smile.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=512980" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/62634/thumb/512980.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/62634/thumb/512980.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/62634/thumb/512980.jpg"/></a><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=512979" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/62634/thumb/512979.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/62634/thumb/512979.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/62634/thumb/512979.jpg"/></a><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=512977" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/62634/thumb/512977.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/62634/thumb/512977.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/62634/thumb/512977.jpg"/></a> <br/></td>', 'Yea! A Top 10, Thank you for all the wonderful comments and votes.  I shot this with my Sigma 28-70 2.8 at dusk in the back yard.  My bush had just started sprouting white flowers and I thought it went nice with the outfit.  I saw the challenge and just knew I had to enter.  My daughter loves tea but she only gets it every now and then so this is actually apple juice. I wanted a lower shot of her looking at the camera but you know kids and I was lucky to get this angle.  I did get one or two staight on but a little out of focus.  It wasn''t long before I got the Daaaaddd!!!! Also as you will see in my outtakes she did a good job of looking serious and she does smile. ', '2007-05-16 02:04:02.000000', NULL, 0),
