(3662540, 508287, 30982, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote in this challenge, and in fact never even got a chance to look at it.  His face is kinda green, but it matches the rest of his outfit nicely.  :-)  I like that you thought this out, overexposed to get your intended result, and went with it despite expecting a low score.  The colors, washed out to some, suit the subject very well, in my opinion.  The whole thing has a nostalgic, washed-out camo kinda thing going.  (My favorite part is the Airborne patch.)</td>', 'I didn''t vote in this challenge, and in fact never even got a chance to look at it.  His face is kinda green, but it matches the rest of his outfit nicely.  :-)  I like that you thought this out, overexposed to get your intended result, and went with it despite expecting a low score.  The colors, washed out to some, suit the subject very well, in my opinion.  The whole thing has a nostalgic, washed-out camo kinda thing going.  (My favorite part is the Airborne patch.)', '2007-05-18 06:53:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(3662544, 509434, 30982, '<td valign="top">As perhaps an interesting byproduct of processing, she looks almost pasted into the shot, which echoes the feeling (or lack of) I get from her facial expression.</td>', 'As perhaps an interesting byproduct of processing, she looks almost pasted into the shot, which echoes the feeling (or lack of) I get from her facial expression.', '2007-05-18 06:58:09.000000', NULL, 0),
