(3662626, 507643, 30982, '<td valign="top">OK, I''m weird, I like the clutter.  Been shooting a lot of cluttered stuff myself, lately.  I like that there are things to see all throughout the picture, like the lady who''s probably undergoing chemo.  I like the gold chair in the background, almost like a throne awaiting royalty, but empty for now since royalty is on vacation.  Neat picture.</td>', 'OK, I''m weird, I like the clutter.  Been shooting a lot of cluttered stuff myself, lately.  I like that there are things to see all throughout the picture, like the lady who''s probably undergoing chemo.  I like the gold chair in the background, almost like a throne awaiting royalty, but empty for now since royalty is on vacation.  Neat picture.', '2007-05-18 07:54:03.000000', NULL, 0),
