(3663459, 509485, 31399, '<td valign="top">this shot is wonderful.  Having lived in Arizona, I learned that native americans hold their festivals and dances very sacred and outside photography is considered offensive.  Students even told me of outsiders harmed due to invading an event.  I admire people who hold to their traditions and "roots".  I also admire photographers who present these people well.  You have a wonderful capture here and do great justice to a proud people.  Congrats ! :-)</td>', 'this shot is wonderful.  Having lived in Arizona, I learned that native americans hold their festivals and dances very sacred and outside photography is considered offensive.  Students even told me of outsiders harmed due to invading an event.  I admire people who hold to their traditions and "roots".  I also admire photographers who present these people well.  You have a wonderful capture here and do great justice to a proud people.  Congrats ! :-)', '2007-05-18 13:31:16.000000', NULL, 0),
